  {
    "id": "GHSA-cggf-277g-3q54",
    "summary": "pypdf has possible large memory usage when parsing page tree",
    "details": "### Impact\n\nAn attacker who uses this vulnerability can craft a PDF which leads to large memory usage. This requires parsing the page tree with many shared resources.\n\n### Patches\n\nThis has been fixed in [pypdf==6.21.4](https://github.com/py-pdf/pypdf/releases/tag/6.21.4).\n\n### Workarounds\n\nIf you cannot upgrade yet, consider applying the changes from PR [#4290](https://github.com/py-pdf/pypdf/pull/4290).",
